   "label": "DERIVED but FAILS its coefficient: with the framework kernel nu_mono the zero-field energy fixes Lambda c^4/a0^2 = 2 pi^4/15, i.e. kappa = sqrt(60/pi^3); it forces rho_DE proportional to a0^2 at fixed kernel, so w = -1 exactly iff a0 is a Lagrangian constant; it gives no rho_DE(z) beyond Lambda"
